      {
        "text": "Robbie Staenberg is a teacher and legislative advisor running for the Santa Monica-Malibu Unified School District Board of Education. He says he attended district schools and taught social studies at a Title I high school in East Oakland from 2018 to 2023, earning a California teaching credential. He says he now works as a legislative advisor for Assemblymember Rick Chavez Zbur. Staenberg says he wants to close achievement gaps. He supports expanding access to early childhood education and after-school programs. He has said he would expand the board's role in artificial intelligence and early education policy.",
